iso-kit.mjs comes from Anatomy (https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy), file kit/iso-kit.mjs,
copied without changes (apart from its two-line header) under the MIT License (see LICENSE). It
provides the isometric camera, the shaded solids and the SVG string helpers used by the figures in
this folder.

parts.mjs, pr-machine.mjs, package-shelf.mjs and org-street.mjs are the generators of the figures on
benmacha.tn/open-source (repository BenMacha/benmacha.github.io, folder utils/anatomy/), and
mario.css holds the same rules as its assets/css/anatomy.css. stack-level.mjs and theme.mjs are
specific to this profile.

fonts/PressStart2P-latin.woff2 is the latin subset of Press Start 2P by The Press Start 2P Project
Authors (cody@zone38.net), as served by Google Fonts, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(see fonts/OFL.txt). It is embedded in each generated SVG.
